WEBVTT

00:00.150 --> 00:01.300
Under Titan's haze.

00:01.969 --> 00:08.284
Saturn never moves in Titan's sky, but you could not see it: the orange haze hides the stars and the planet.

00:08.816 --> 00:10.621
They are drawn faintly where they are.

00:11.128 --> 00:13.957
The colour is a picture of words, not a photograph.
